- Thread-safe LRU cache with capacity bound and strict eviction policy.
- Per-key-version AES-256 GCM encryptor with 12-byte nonce composed of 8 random + 4-byte atomic counter.
- Atomic nonce counter per key version for concurrency-safe unique nonces.
- Multi-version key fallback on decryption.
